{
  "uid": "atlas-golden-signals",
  "title": "Atlas Observability — Golden Signals (Tawira)",
  "tags": ["atlas", "golden-signals", "tawira"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Golden Signals — atlas-demo-api",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request Rate (RPS)",
      "description": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])) by (http_request_method)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])) by (http_request_method)",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_request_method}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error Rate (5xx %)",
      "description": "5xx responses as a percentage of total requests, 5m window",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile over http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by Status Code",
      "description": "sum(rate(...count[5m])) by (http_response_status_code)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])) by (http_response_status_code)",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Saturation — not yet instrumented",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**No saturation signal exists yet.**\n\n`instrumentation.mjs` only wires HTTP request/trace/log telemetry — no `@opentelemetry/host-metrics` (or equivalent) for CPU, memory, or event-loop lag. Rather than fake this panel with a proxy metric, it's tracked honestly as a gap.\n\n**Next step:** add `@opentelemetry/host-metrics`, wire it into the existing `metricReaders` array in `instrumentation.mjs`, confirm `process_cpu_seconds_total` / `nodejs_eventloop_lag_seconds` land in Prometheus, then replace this panel."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pipeline Health — OTel Collector",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17 }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans Accepted (rate)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans[5m]))", "legendFormat": "spans/s", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log Records Accepted (rate)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 18 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_log_records[5m]))", "legendFormat": "logs/s", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metric Points Accepted (rate)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 18 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_metric_points[5m]))", "legendFormat": "metric points/s", "refId": "A" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}